---
import { SITE, SOCIAL } from '../consts';
---

<section id="about" class="pt-20 sm:pt-32 pb-24 sm:pb-36">
  <!-- Section Title Bar -->
  <div class="mb-14 sm:mb-20">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-700 font-bold uppercase mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent-600 rounded-full"></span>
      <span>05 / THE MAKER</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-serif font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-surface-950 tracking-tight">
      Lio<i class="not-italic text-accent-600">.</i>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
    <!-- Left Column: Biography & Ethos (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-surface-800 leading-relaxed font-sans font-normal">
        现居深圳。关注 AI Agent 落地、工作流自动化与全栈工程实现。业余时间拍延时与星空，热衷纯粹驾驶与机械质感。
      </p>

      <p class="text-base text-surface-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
        信奉<strong>「自己遇到问题 → 自己造工具 → 生产环境自用 → 持续迭代打磨」</strong>。这个站点是我的公开档案馆：只记真做过的，数字拿得出处。
      </p>

      <div class="p-5 border-l-2 border-accent-600 bg-surface-100/60 font-mono text-xs text-surface-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="font-bold text-surface-900 mb-2">写在这个站点的三条规矩：</div>
        <div>1. 只记真做过的，数字拿得出处</div>
        <div>2. 一天一篇，不攒总结</div>
        <div>3. 没搞完的事就坦白写没搞完</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4">
        <a
          href={`${SITE.base}/about`}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 border border-surface-950 bg-surface-950 text-surface-50 hover:bg-accent-700 hover:border-accent-700 transition-colors font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest"
        >
          <span>View Full About & Experience</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Specs & Direct Connect (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 border border-surface-300/80 bg-surface-100/50 p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-5 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-surface-400 uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-surface-200/80 pb-3">
        Field Profile & System
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3.5 text-surface-600">
        <div>
          <span class="text-surface-400 block text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase">Base Location</span>
          <span class="text-surface-900 font-bold">Shenzhen, Guangdong, China</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-surface-400 block text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase">Core Stack</span>
          <span class="text-surface-900 font-bold">AI Agents · MV3 · Python · Astro · FastAPI</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-surface-400 block text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase">Inference Hardware</span>
          <span class="text-surface-900 font-bold">Mac M4 + LAN 4090 GPU Node</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-surface-400 block text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase">Field Camera & Gear</span>
          <span class="text-surface-900 font-bold">Panasonic Lumix S5M2</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-surface-200/80 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href={SOCIAL.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-3 py-1.5 border border-surface-300 bg-surface-50 hover:border-accent-600 hover:text-accent-600 transition-colors font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider"
        >
          GITHUB ↗
        </a>
        <a
          href={`${SITE.base}/rss.xml`}
          class="px-3 py-1.5 border border-surface-300 bg-surface-50 hover:border-accent-600 hover:text-accent-600 transition-colors font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider"
        >
          RSS FEED ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
